# ser.ops mail accounts — copy to mail-accounts.conf and fill in the passwords.
#
#   name|imap-host|username|password|trash-folder
#
# mail-accounts.conf is GITIGNORED. This .example file is committed; the real
# one must never be. Check `git check-ignore -v deploy/mail-accounts.conf`
# before your first commit after editing.
#
# The three entries below are the mailboxes that actually exist on unit2's
# docker-mailserver (`docker exec mailserver setup email list`). Passwords are
# blank on purpose — mail-ops.sh skips any row with an empty password and logs
# "no password configured", so this file is safe to copy as-is and fill in one
# mailbox at a time.
#
# Those mailbox passwords are already stored, sealed with AES-256-GCM, in
# Reech's mail_accounts table (see projects/reech/.env on unit2). They are
# recoverable through Reech rather than by reading the database directly.
#
# unit9 is the MX edge and unit2 is the mailbox store; IMAP is reached through
# the haproxy on unit9 that proxies 143/993 to unit2, which is why the host
# below is the mail hostname and not unit2's address.

# ── House mailboxes (unit2 / docker-mailserver) ───────────────────────
reech|mail.theofficialblacksheepco.com|reech@theofficialblacksheepco.com||Trash
support|mail.theofficialblacksheepco.com|support@puff-base.com||Trash
swoopg111|mail.theofficialblacksheepco.com|swoopg111@puff-base.com||Trash

# ── External providers ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# These host/trash-folder pairs and the auth notes were in the original
# version of this file; keeping them because they are the fiddly part.
#
#   gmail   -> imap.gmail.com         app pw: myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
#   yahoo   -> imap.mail.yahoo.com    app pw: account.yahoo.com -> Security -> app passwords
#   hotmail -> outlook.office365.com  basic auth may be OFF (OAuth2 needed if login fails)
#
# Note the trash folder differs per provider — Gmail wants the literal
# "[Gmail]/Trash", Yahoo uses "Bulk", Outlook uses "Deleted".
#
# gmail|imap.gmail.com|blackshepherddeveloper@gmail.com|PASTE_APP_PASSWORD|[Gmail]/Trash
# yahoo|imap.mail.yahoo.com|you@yahoo.com|PASTE_APP_PASSWORD|Bulk
# hotmail|outlook.office365.com|you@hotmail.com|PASTE_APP_PASSWORD|Deleted
